{
  "an4.55:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 4.55 ",
  "an4.55:0.2": "6. Puññābhisandavagga ",
  "an4.55:0.3": "Paṭhamasamajīvīsutta ",
  "an4.55:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "an4.55:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā bhaggesu viharati susumāragire bhesakaḷāvane migadāye. ",
  "an4.55:1.3": "Atha kho bhagavā pubbaṇhasamayaṁ nivāsetvā pattacīvaramādāya yena nakulapituno gahapatissa nivesanaṁ tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā paññatte āsane nisīdi. ",
  "an4.55:1.4": "Atha kho nakulapitā ca gahapati nakulamātā ca gahapatānī yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkamiṁsu; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ nisīdiṁsu. Ekamantaṁ nisinno kho nakulapitā gahapati bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "an4.55:2.1": "“Yato me, bhante, nakulamātā gahapatānī daharasseva daharā ānītā, nābhijānāmi nakulamātaraṁ gahapatāniṁ manasāpi aticaritā, kuto pana kāyena. ",
  "an4.55:2.2": "Iccheyyāma mayaṁ, bhante, diṭṭhe ceva dhamme aññamaññaṁ passituṁ abhisamparāyañca aññamaññaṁ passitun”ti. ",
  "an4.55:2.3": "Nakulamātāpi kho gahapatānī bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "an4.55:2.4": "“yatohaṁ, bhante, nakulapituno gahapatissa daharasseva daharā ānītā, nābhijānāmi nakulapitaraṁ gahapatiṁ manasāpi aticaritā, kuto pana kāyena. ",
  "an4.55:2.5": "Iccheyyāma mayaṁ, bhante, diṭṭhe ceva dhamme aññamaññaṁ passituṁ abhisamparāyañca aññamaññaṁ passitun”ti. ",
  "an4.55:3.1": "“Ākaṅkheyyuñce, gahapatayo, ubho 